cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Leaf in your work, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "Leaf"
abstract: >-
  Leaf is a strongly and statically typed quantum programming language
  implemented in Idris 2. It has Rust-like syntax, compiles to OpenQASM 3,
  and enables Lean 4-based formal verification of quantum algorithms.
authors:
  - family-names: "Marginean"
    given-names: "Radu"
repository-code: "https://github.com/radumarg/leaf-qpl"
url: "https://github.com/radumarg/leaf-qpl"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - "quantum programming language"
  - "quantum computing"
  - "formal verification"
  - "Idris 2"
  - "Lean 4"
  - "OpenQASM 3"
